# PROVIDENCE reporting what the power/atmos diagnostics detect. Evil-corporate-HR voice:
# the station's problems are framed as the crew's performance problem. PG, no em-dashes.

solreign-diagnostic-power-strained = Grid advisory. Draw is outpacing supply and reserves are at { $headroom } percent. Consumption is a choice, and it is being recorded as one.
solreign-diagnostic-power-brownout = Brownout conditions. Reserves at { $headroom } percent. Non-essential systems are now a luxury the shift has not earned. Engineering is invited to explain itself.
solreign-diagnostic-power-blackout = Grid failure. Reserves at { $headroom } percent. PROVIDENCE notes for the record that this was preventable, and by whom.
solreign-diagnostic-power-restored = Grid stable. Reserves at { $headroom } percent. The incident remains in your file.
